pdbx_details:
;crystals were initially produced from 50 mM Tris (pH 7.5), 20 mM DTT, 25 mM MgCl2, 50 mM 3PG, and 10 mM ADP, supplemented with 20 mM NH4F and 1 mM deferoxamine;  in 28-33% PEG 2000 MME and 0.1 M Bis/Tris pH 6.5
then cross-soaked with 35% PEG 2000 MME; 0.1 M Bis/Tris pH 6.5, 20 mM DTT, and 50 mM 3PG and 0.1mM deferoxamine
